              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele ncito zyakwe zyoonse zyanguzu azyabwami, alimwi alwaambo loonse lwa bwami mobuli mwami mwaakamubika Moodekai, tazilembedwe na mumalembo aabwami aa-Media a-Persia ",
          "type": "text",
