        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Moodekai muJuda wakali wabili kubwami Ahasuera; wakali muntu mupati akati kaba-Juda alimwi akuyandwa abasimukowanyina, nkaambo wakayandaula bubotu bwabantu bakwe akulondola kukupuka kwamukowa wakwe woonse.",
